<section class="section fond-doux" id="acces"><div class="conteneur deux-col">
  <div>
    <h2>Getting here</h2>
    <p class="note-encadree"><strong>For your GPS, do not use the postal address.</strong> Type “{{ site.contact.gps }}” or the coordinates 43.362408, 3.319105. And follow either our directions or your GPS, never both at once.</p>
    <p class="actions"><a class="bouton secondaire" href="{{ site.contact.carte }}" rel="noopener">Open in Google Maps</a><a class="bouton secondaire" href="{{ site.contact.carte_apple }}" rel="noopener">Open in Apple Maps</a></p>
    <h3>From the A9</h3>
    <p>Take exit 35 “Béziers Centre”. At the 1st roundabout, follow signs for Béziers-Centre. At the 2nd and 3rd roundabouts, follow signs for Pézenas. At the 4th, follow signs for N9 / PAE La Baume. Go straight on along the N9 for 3.5 km, then turn right towards “Domaine de Clairac / Camping Clairac”.</p>
    <h3>From the A75</h3>
    <p>Take exit 63 “Béziers-Centre”. At the roundabout, turn right towards N9 / PAE La Baume. Go straight on along the N9 for 3.5 km, then turn right towards “Domaine de Clairac / Camping Clairac”.</p>
    <p>The last few kilometres are on a well-kept dirt track, as you would expect of a true natural campsite.</p>
    <p class="petit">Postal address, for post only: {{ site.contact.adresse }}.</p>
  </div>
