      <h3>Wildfire warning area</h3>
      <p>The campsite is in an area classed as high risk for wildfires. Open fires and ground-level barbecues are strictly forbidden: only electric or gas barbecues are allowed, with a single gas bottle per set-up.</p>
      <p>Never drop a cigarette butt on the ground. The safety of everyone, campers and forest alike, depends on it.</p>
